<details open class="course-list-block">
    <summary>Katalogda bulunmayan ders talebi</summary>
    <p>Talep koordinatörle kendi sohbetinize gönderilir. Katalog veya ders seçimi otomatik oluşturulmaz.</p>
    <form asp-controller="DersTalebi" asp-action="Gonder" method="post" class="ders-talebi-form" data-done-url="@Url.Action("Sohbet", "Panel")">
        <input type="hidden" name="IstekId" value="@Guid.NewGuid()" />
        <div class="registration-row">
            <label>Ders kodu<input name="DersKodu" maxlength="50" required /></label>
            <label>Ders adı<input name="DersAdi" maxlength="250" required /></label>
        </div>
        <label>Açıklama<textarea name="Aciklama" rows="1" maxlength="1000" class="auto-grow-field"></textarea></label>
        <button type="submit" class="text-button">Talebi gönder</button>
        <p role="alert"></p>
    </form>
</details>
